{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"agent_message","text":"I’m using the game-toolchain skill for the game’s art, animation, and headless checks. The plan centers on one bomber’s full sortie, so navigation, combat, bombing, and recovery will share the same aircraft state.\n"}}
