{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_33","type":"agent_message","text":"The native 3D renderer, procedural audio, and Hub adapter are in place. Early checks caught two issues: replay could suppress warnings from the previous sortie, and flak left too little room to evade. Both have been corrected; full mission tests are now checking route and resource balance.\n"}}
